    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>🚉 </span><strong><span>第93站</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>延续「华语10佳」，本期我们继续畅聊外语片年度10佳，区别于华语的相对局限性，外语片我们3人的选择都更为广阔，有人偏爱新导演新作，有人偏爱议题尖锐之作，我们各自用选择与偏好锚定2025年的情绪与心态，我们关注电影作为媒介，以各自的方式回应或重构这个时代的精神图景——无论是技术的、政治的，还是纯粹关乎人类处境的。这个世界正在鉴别成分，寻找同类，我们也不例外。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在分享各自偏好的同时，我们经常发出外部世界的情感议题表达已是next level 的感慨，那种遥远的、模糊的情感共通之处也在滋养着我们这样的影迷，2026年也想继续如饥似渴地看下去。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家跟我们分享自己2025年的年度外语片10佳，光影交错，站台广播声波依旧。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>🚉 </span><strong><span>李逵艾的外语十佳</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>1.《罪人》</span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4863">1:21:03</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>2.《一战再战》</span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4446">1:14:06</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>3.《普通事故》</span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4082">1:08:02</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>4.《如果有腿，我会踢你》</span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3704">1:01:44</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>5.《寂静的朋友》</span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3376">56:16</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>6.《爱国少女》</span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2865">47:45</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>7.《总统的蛋糕》</span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2554">42:34</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>8.《有用的鬼》</span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2109">35:09</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>9.《3670》</span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1569">26:09</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>10.《夜班》</span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a></span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>🚉 </span><strong><span>一口大井子的外语十佳</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><sp